sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Repository Admin
    participant DASH as Next.js Dashboard
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant OR as Orchestrator

    Admin->>DASH: open Agent Config for a repository
    DASH->>GW: GET /v1/repositories/{id}/config
    GW->>GW: check admin role in the owning organization
    alt caller is not an admin
        GW-->>DASH: 403 forbidden
        DASH-->>Admin: read-only view
    else caller is an admin
        GW->>DB: read repository_agent_config + repository_settings
        DB-->>GW: per-agent flags, override, org default
        GW-->>DASH: effective config + thresholdSource
        DASH-->>Admin: five agent toggles, threshold slider showing<br/>where the current value comes from
    end

    Admin->>DASH: toggle an agent off
    opt threshold override control has shipped (FR-WEB-03, Should)
        Admin->>DASH: drag the confidence threshold slider
        Note over DASH: until this ships, the platform default of 0.8<br/>applies and steps 1-2, 4-5 still work (FR-ORC-06)
    end
    Admin->>DASH: Save changes

    DASH->>GW: PUT /v1/repositories/{id}/config
    GW->>GW: validate — at least one agent must stay enabled

    alt every agent disabled
        GW-->>DASH: 400 no_agents_enabled
        DASH-->>Admin: inline error, nothing is saved
        Note over DB: the previous configuration is left untouched
    else valid
        GW->>DB: upsert repository_agent_config + repository_settings
        DB-->>GW: saved, updated_by and updated_at recorded
        GW-->>DASH: 200 effective config
        DASH-->>Admin: saved
    end

    Note over GW,OR: the change is not retro-active

    Admin->>DASH: a later pull request triggers a review
    DASH->>GW: (webhook path, UC-1)
    GW->>DB: resolve enabled agents + threshold
    DB-->>GW: the new configuration
    GW->>OR: POST /internal/v1/review-jobs (enabledAgents, confidenceThreshold)
    OR-->>GW: the disabled agent is not called at all (AC-07)
